From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 11:02:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): use panel width for property labels

Grow property labels with the panel and share the helper with checkbox rows.
Reserve compact control space in narrow panels.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2295
